<title>INDIA: CRICKET-TITAN CUP TRIANGULAR ONE-DAY SERIES STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-TITAN CUP TRIANGULAR ONE-DAY SERIES STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>CUTTACK, India 1996-10-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Titan Cup triangular</p>
<p>one-day series standings after Sunday's match between India and</p>
<p>Australia was abandoned because of rain (tabulate under played,</p>
<p>won, no result, lost, points):</p>
<p> South Africa   4     4     0     0     8</p>
<p> India	    4     1     1     2     3</p>
<p> Australia	4     0     1     3     1</p>
<p>Next match: Oct 29 - India v South Africa (in Rajkot)</p>
</text>
